# Build context of the demo image (apps/demo/Dockerfile). The context is the
# repository root, since the image builds the workspace packages the demo
# depends on, so this file has to sit here: Docker reads the .dockerignore at
# the root of the context, never the one next to the Dockerfile.
.git
.github
.env*
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
*.md
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
e2e
examples
packages/*/__tests__
